    <h2>Mechanics</h2>
    <ul class="note">
        <li>Blade touches water → retracts</li>
        <li>Hilt touches water → vanishes</li>
        <li>All blades share a white-to-color gradient from the emitter</li>
        <li>Gradients may be randomised per spawn</li>
        <li>Legendary colors (white/black) flash briefly when moved</li>
    </ul>

